---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="What's new · Niyora">
  <div class="container">
    <a class="back" href="/">← Back to Niyora</a>
    <h1>What's new</h1>
    <p class="lede">Every Niyora release, in plain language. Newest first.</p>

    <article class="release">
      <header>
        <h2>v0.3.0</h2>
        <span class="date">May 11, 2026</span>
      </header>
      <ul>
        <li>Windows support. Tray icon, panel, native toasts, installer.</li>
        <li>Tray icon spins gently during onboarding.</li>
        <li>Soft glow and cross-fade on the breathing phase label.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="release">
      <header>
        <h2>v0.2.0</h2>
        <span class="date">May 8, 2026</span>
      </header>
      <ul>
        <li>Styled installer on macOS.</li>
        <li>First-launch panel polish.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="release">
      <header>
        <h2>v0.1.2</h2>
        <span class="date">May 1, 2026</span>
      </header>
      <ul>
        <li>In-app auto-updates. Niyora keeps itself current.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="release">
      <header>
        <h2>v0.1.1</h2>
        <span class="date">May 1, 2026</span>
      </header>
      <ul>
        <li>Polish pass. Small fixes and visual refinements.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="release">
      <header>
        <h2>v0.1.0</h2>
        <span class="date">Apr 29, 2026</span>
      </header>
      <p class="release-lede">First public release.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Fourteen practices. Pranayama, mindfulness, grounding, self-compassion.</li>
        <li>My Soul. Your growing visual companion.</li>
        <li>Situational signals. Niyora reads your work rhythm and nudges when stress is building.</li>
        <li>Smart reminders.</li>
        <li>Practice picker and onboarding.</li>
        <li>Mac builds for Apple Silicon and Intel. Signed by Apple Developer ID and notarized.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <p class="foot">Want to know when the next one ships? <a href="/talk">Say hello</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  body { background: #0a0814; }
  .container {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 24px 80px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  }
  a.back {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  a.back:hover { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); }

  h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .release {
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .release header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .release h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  }
  .release .date {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  }
  .release-lede {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .release ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .release li {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
    padding: 6px 0 6px 18px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .release li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 16px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: hsla(230, 50%, 70%, 0.5);
  }

  .foot {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .foot a {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }
  .foot a:hover { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); }
</style>
